                                                        <rect key="frame" x="12" y="62" width="319" height="234"/>
                                                        <string key="text">Mid Term Results provide an overview of students’ academic performance for the first half of the term.
They help evaluate progress across all subjects covered so far.
These results reflect both understanding and consistency in studies.
Teachers use this assessment to identify strengths and areas for improvement.
Students can use the feedback to focus on weaker subjects.
It plays an important role in preparing for final examinations.</string>
